This product is a Kotlin Multiplatform port of Mozilla Rhino
(https://github.com/mozilla/rhino), pinned at release 1.9.1
(tag Rhino1_9_1_Release, commit f2d1ffef9dafbd625ca1ea79b8893ecbaee07e61).

Rhino is Copyright Mozilla and individual contributors, licensed under the
Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0. As a derivative work, KiteJS keeps the
MPL-2.0 license, and every ported source file keeps the MPL license header.
See LICENSE for the full text, which also covers the BSD-licensed number
formatting code (v8dtoa) that Rhino itself vendors.

The interpreter path is ported; Rhino's JVM bytecode compiler, E4X/XML support,
Java interop (LiveConnect) and tooling are out of scope and contain no KiteJS
code.
